<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-chemistries> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-extinguisher-classes> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-labeling> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-locations> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-materials> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals> .
